marco only  cares about power while he speaks to  real issues that the belters face  his actions aren't guided by that his  deal with the future laconians made it  possible for him to stir things up and  grab a bit of power  so we'll have to see what he does with  it avasarala seems to have the right  ideas on how to unite people against the  free navy but the moderate faction of  the opa has a fred johnson sized hole in  it the laconians are an interesting  twist  and once again the humans are messing  with the proto-molecule  because what he's seen inside the ring  station with the investigator what he  saw on ellis  holden is still one of the only people  who really understand how dangerous this  is  and with everything else that's going on  he may be the only one who's really  paying attention  and that seems like a great place to  leave it let me know what you think in  the comments and if you have any  questions about what happened in season  5  and questions you have about the  upcoming season 6.  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already  i'll have more expanse videos coming out  this week thanks for watching i'll talk  to you soon
 

